+            Cenomars, birth certificates, barangay clearance, and any pre-
+            marriage counseling cert your LGU requires.
+          </p>
+          <p className="mt-2 text-ink/65">
+            <strong>Hard 120-day rule:</strong> the license is valid for 120 days from
